<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:01.133" style="s2">We&#39;re having twins.</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.400" end="00:00:03.200" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait to tell Caspian.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.800" end="00:00:05.133" style="s2">Bro, she still doesn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.733" end="00:00:06.733" style="s2">We switched places.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.733" end="00:00:07.533" style="s2">That voice?</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.733" end="00:00:09.333" style="s2">And she never had a clue.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.533" end="00:00:16.066" style="s2">Her father died holding<br />Blackwood secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.066" end="00:00:17.733" style="s2">So we kept her close.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.866" end="00:00:20.466" style="s2">No...</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.133" end="00:00:22.333" style="s2">that can&#39;t be true.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.466" end="00:00:23.666" style="s2">Caspian...</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.666" end="00:00:24.933" style="s2">what did you do to me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.933" end="00:00:31.533" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.866" end="00:00:32.933" style="s2">You heard us.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.866" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">There were two of you</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.600" end="00:00:39.333" style="s2">this whole time?</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.400" end="00:00:41.333" style="s2">Look at us, Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.900" end="00:00:43.666" style="s2">Can you even tell the<br />difference?</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.666" end="00:00:45.600" style="s2">Which one of you was with me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:48.200" style="s2">Some nights it was him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.200" end="00:00:49.333" style="s2">We switched places.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.333" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">You let me think</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:51.733" style="s2">there was only one of you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.666" end="00:00:53.666" style="s2">She&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.266" end="00:00:55.866" style="s2">So whose baby is it, Elena?</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.666" end="00:01:01.066" style="s2">Caspian.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.066" end="00:01:02.066" style="s2">Please,</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.066" end="00:01:03.400" style="s2">I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.400" end="00:01:05.000" style="s2">Which one of us?</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.266" end="00:01:06.866" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.866" end="00:01:08.266" style="s2">Why would you do this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.266" end="00:01:10.400" style="s2">Your father died holding our<br />secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.800" end="00:01:12.200" style="s2">So we kept you close.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:14.000" style="s2">Marriage keeps you right where we want you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:15.200" style="s2">Tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.200" end="00:01:17.466" style="s2">she&#39;s gonna walk down that<br />aisle smiling.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.666" end="00:01:20.533" style="s2">Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.533" end="00:01:23.133" style="s2">Go clean yourself up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.866" end="00:01:25.533" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to see this mess<br />tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.466" end="00:01:27.266" style="s2">Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.066" end="00:01:29.200" style="s2">The babies are innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.500" end="00:01:30.933" style="s2">If you want those babies alive,</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.800" end="00:01:34.133" style="s2">you walk down that aisle like<br />nothing happened.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.800" end="00:01:36.400" style="s2">And you don&#39;t say a damn word.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.400" end="00:01:37.733" style="s2">It was all a lie, wasn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.733" end="00:01:38.766" style="s2">The love was.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.766" end="00:01:40.200" style="s2">I needed obedience.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.266" end="00:01:41.333" style="s2">You&#39;re a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.800" end="00:01:42.400" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.800" end="00:01:44.466" style="s2">That&#39;s the price of your<br />choice.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.000" end="00:01:46.400" style="s2">And consequence..</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.600" end="00:01:47.733" style="s2">don&#39;t apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.266" end="00:01:49.866" style="s2">Keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.666" end="00:01:53.400" style="s2">Every girl needs something to cry about.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.866" end="00:01:59.266" style="s2">I&#39;ll remember every face in<br />this room.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.666" end="00:02:02.533" style="s2">Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.600" end="00:02:03.600" style="s2">Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.666" end="00:02:04.933" style="s2">We&#39;ve completed the full<br />investigation</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.933" end="00:02:05.933" style="s2">on Elena Miller.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.066" end="00:02:07.733" style="s2">She&#39;s scheduled to marry<br />Caspian tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.733" end="00:02:09.333" style="s2">Noon at the Blackwood private villa.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.533" end="00:02:11.266" style="s2">According to insider<br />information,</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.266" end="00:02:13.400" style="s2">Caspian and Silas have reached a private deal.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.666" end="00:02:14.933" style="s2">They plan to humiliate her in public.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.933" end="00:02:16.866" style="s2">At the wedding and ruin her reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.000" end="00:02:18.000" style="s2">Get the car ready.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.000" end="00:02:19.066" style="s2">And prep my suit.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.066" end="00:02:20.266" style="s2">I&#39;ll attend the wedding<br />tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.266" end="00:02:21.133" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.133" end="00:02:22.733" style="s2">I&#39;ll make all arrangements in<br />advance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.666" end="00:02:31.400" style="s2">That&#39;s Silas Blackwood, right?</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.800" end="00:02:32.933" style="s2">That&#39;s Silas.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.266" end="00:02:34.200" style="s2">Caspian&#39;s twin.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.800" end="00:02:35.600" style="s2">There she is.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.933" end="00:02:36.733" style="s2">She looks pale.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.333" end="00:02:40.066" style="s2">Smile.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.733" end="00:02:41.600" style="s2">That&#39;s it,</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.600" end="00:02:43.066" style="s2">pretty girls don&#39;t shake.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.533" end="00:02:45.733" style="s2">You&#39;re enjoying this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.333" end="00:02:47.466" style="s2">I paid for it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.866" end="00:02:52.666" style="s2">Look at her,</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.666" end="00:02:53.533" style="s2">she&#39;s shaking.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.800" end="00:02:54.933" style="s2">Maybe she finally realized</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.933" end="00:02:55.933" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t belong here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.466" end="00:03:01.400" style="s2">Careful, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.066" end="00:03:03.666" style="s2">cameras love a nervous bride.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.000" end="00:03:08.000" style="s2">Caspian Blackwood,</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.800" end="00:03:11.200" style="s2">will you have this woman to be your wedded wife,</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.600" end="00:03:13.733" style="s2">to live together in the holy<br />bond of marriage?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.866" end="00:03:16.866" style="s2">I don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.933" end="00:03:26.800" style="s2">Caspian?</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.800" end="00:03:27.600" style="s2">Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.800" end="00:03:29.466" style="s2">The show begins.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.466" end="00:03:33.333" style="s2">Tumn it off.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.333" end="00:03:33.933" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.933" end="00:03:35.066" style="s2">That&#39;s not what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.066" end="00:03:36.266" style="s2">No one cares about the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.266" end="00:03:37.800" style="s2">They care about the scandal</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.666" end="00:03:42.133" style="s2">There&#39;s not gonna be a wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.400" end="00:03:45.933" style="s2">Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.933" end="00:03:47.733" style="s2">You were a tool from the start.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.733" end="00:03:53.266" style="s2">You planned everything.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.266" end="00:03:55.066" style="s2">You loved your way into this<br />trap.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.533" end="00:03:57.266" style="s2">I gave you all my love.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.866" end="00:04:00.866" style="s2">Love which one?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.200" end="00:04:03.466" style="s2">Me, or him?</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.666" end="00:04:07.066" style="s2">Look closely, darling.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.733" end="00:04:10.400" style="s2">Do you know who was with you last night?</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.600" end="00:04:14.600" style="s2">You two shared the same face to deceive me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.100" end="00:04:18.066" style="s2">Night after night, you took turns staying with me!</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.066" end="00:04:20.533" style="s2">You&#39;ve both been using me this whole time!</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.533" end="00:04:21.266" style="s2">God!</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.533" end="00:04:22.400" style="s2">Look at you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.400" end="00:04:23.666" style="s2">Don&#39;t come near me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.666" end="00:04:25.133" style="s2">I&#39;m just correcting the look.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.933" end="00:04:28.666" style="s2">Look at you, covered in filth.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.866" end="00:04:30.066" style="s2">So pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.333" end="00:04:31.866" style="s2">This wedding dress looks</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.866" end="00:04:33.333" style="s2">so much better on you stained red.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.466" end="00:04:36.200" style="s2">Unlucky for you, you got<br />pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.200" end="00:04:38.133" style="s2">And he never wanted your kid.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.400" end="00:04:40.000" style="s2">We&#39;ve been playing you for years.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.000" end="00:04:41.666" style="s2">Pregnancy was just extra fun.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.000" end="00:04:43.066" style="s2">After this wedding farce.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.066" end="00:04:44.133" style="s2">you will get rid of them.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.533" end="00:04:45.800" style="s2">Over my dead body.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.800" end="00:04:47.666" style="s2">I&#39;m escaping from<br />both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.666" end="00:04:49.266" style="s2">You really think youre the<br />victim here?</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.533" end="00:04:51.600" style="s2">Everyone knows exactly what you are.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.733" end="00:04:54.266" style="s2">No one even knows whose<br />bastards those babies are.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.133" end="00:04:59.733" style="s2">Stop putting on that fierce<br />face.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.733" end="00:05:01.200" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but a pathetic<br />loser.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.200" end="00:05:02.200" style="s2">You know nothing</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.400" end="00:05:04.600" style="s2">They used identical faces to<br />fool me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.600" end="00:05:06.066" style="s2">Caspian wants to ki*l<br />my babies!</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.066" end="00:05:08.000" style="s2">He wants to ruin me completely!</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.200" end="00:05:10.666" style="s2">I won&#39;t let myself be a pawn in your twisted game.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.000" end="00:05:13.933" style="s2">Bring her back.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.266" end="00:05:15.000" style="s2">Gladly.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.800" end="00:05:17.666" style="s2">She&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.733" end="00:05:22.600" style="s2">I won&#39;t forgive a single<br />one of you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.200" end="00:05:33.066" style="s2">There you are.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.600" end="00:05:35.000" style="s2">Please,</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.000" end="00:05:35.733" style="s2">don&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.733" end="00:05:36.600" style="s2">film me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.600" end="00:05:37.866" style="s2">Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.266" end="00:05:39.133" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch her.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.333" end="00:05:40.533" style="s2">Just keep back.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.066" end="00:05:45.200" style="s2">Look at her.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.200" end="00:05:46.200" style="s2">So desperate.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.200" end="00:05:47.200" style="s2">So ugly</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.866" end="00:05:48.866" style="s2">Pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.200" end="00:05:49.866" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.866" end="00:05:50.666" style="s2">He can&#39;t take me back,</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.666" end="00:05:51.600" style="s2">you don&#39;t understand.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.600" end="00:05:52.200" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry,</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.200" end="00:05:53.533" style="s2">I can&#39;t get in the middle of<br />this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.000" end="00:05:55.266" style="s2">Baby,</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.266" end="00:05:56.800" style="s2">nobody here wants a lawsuit</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.800" end="00:05:57.533" style="s2">before lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.666" end="00:06:02.533" style="s2">Please,</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.533" end="00:06:03.466" style="s2">help me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.200" end="00:06:05.333" style="s2">Someone help me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.266" end="00:06:15.200" style="s2">The door.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.866" end="00:06:16.733" style="s2">Run.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.933" end="00:06:24.333" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.466" end="00:06:25.266" style="s2">Elena, come on.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.266" end="00:06:26.333" style="s2">You can&#39;t outrun this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.600" end="00:06:26.933" style="s2">Miss!</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.933" end="00:06:28.000" style="s2">This area is closed.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.000" end="00:06:28.333" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.333" end="00:06:29.533" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.600" end="00:06:30.133" style="s2">Hey! Wait!</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.133" end="00:06:31.133" style="s2">That&#39;s not your van.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.866" end="00:06:34.133" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid, babies.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.466" end="00:06:36.000" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s getting you out of<br />here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.666" end="00:06:37.200" style="s2">Open the door</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.200" end="00:06:37.666" style="s2">before this gets</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.666" end="00:06:38.666" style="s2">embarrassing for everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.666" end="00:06:39.333" style="s2">Get away from me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.000" end="00:06:42.000" style="s2">No police,</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.333" end="00:06:43.000" style="s2">no hospital</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.933" end="00:06:45.666" style="s2">I want her quiet and breathing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.333" end="00:06:49.266" style="s2">Bring her back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.333" end="00:07:00.266" style="s2">There you are.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.266" end="00:07:01.066" style="s2">Let&#39;s play</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.866" end="00:07:07.533" style="s2">Track the van.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.266" end="00:07:12.666" style="s2">Don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.200" end="00:07:18.333" style="s2">Please let there be a road.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.666" end="00:07:41.000" style="s2">Open the door, Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.266" end="00:07:42.800" style="s2">This doesn&#39;t have to end this<br />way.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.600" end="00:07:44.000" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.200" end="00:07:45.400" style="s2">I won&#39;t go back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.933" end="00:07:46.400" style="s2">Never.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.933" end="00:07:50.133" style="s2">Okay, babies.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.933" end="00:07:52.933" style="s2">Looks like we&#39;re gonna have to take a gamble.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.266" end="00:07:54.533" style="s2">You already lost everything,</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.533" end="00:07:55.533" style="s2">don&#39;t be stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.666" end="00:08:01.266" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.666" end="00:08:06.466" style="s2">Elena!</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.300" end="00:08:12.100" style="s2">I&#39;ve got her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.166" end="00:08:13.166" style="s2">She&#39;s still inside.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.500" end="00:08:14.300" style="s2">Cut the belt.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.500" end="00:08:15.433" style="s2">Keep her head up.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.966" end="00:08:21.166" style="s2">She&#39;s not breathing right.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.366" end="00:08:27.366" style="s2">Elena, can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.366" end="00:08:28.233" style="s2">Stay with us.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.366" end="00:08:29.633" style="s2">She was under too long.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.966" end="00:08:30.766" style="s2">Keep Elena alive.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.366" end="00:08:32.766" style="s2">Nothing else matters yet.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.966" end="00:08:34.633" style="s2">That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.633" end="00:08:35.366" style="s2">Breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.766" end="00:08:36.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.700" end="00:08:38.300" style="s2">My.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.433" end="00:08:39.033" style="s2">babies.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.033" end="00:08:40.033" style="s2">We&#39;re checking you first.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.100" end="00:08:41.033" style="s2">Stay awake for me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.233" end="00:08:42.033" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.433" end="00:08:43.166" style="s2">Check them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.766" end="00:08:44.500" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.433" end="00:08:47.500" style="s2">Tell me you can see her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.966" end="00:08:48.566" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.366" end="00:08:50.166" style="s2">She went under.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.366" end="00:08:52.300" style="s2">Find the van before anyone else does.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.300" end="00:08:53.433" style="s2">She actually did it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.766" end="00:08:56.833" style="s2">I need a hospital ready.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.433" end="00:08:59.033" style="s2">Keep her off the emergency<br />channels.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.433" end="00:09:00.566" style="s2">She almost drowned.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.900" end="00:09:02.233" style="s2">Blackwood can&#39;t know she<br />survived.</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.500" end="00:09:03.700" style="s2">My babies...</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.700" end="00:09:04.500" style="s2">Check them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.966" end="00:09:07.566" style="s2">Say something.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.233" end="00:09:09.433" style="s2">I&#39;m not getting a clear<br />heartbeat.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.633" end="00:09:10.066" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.100" end="00:09:10.766" style="s2">Try again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.766" end="00:09:12.033" style="s2">We need an obstetric team.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.033" end="00:09:12.700" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.700" end="00:09:13.433" style="s2">Bring them to her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.433" end="00:09:14.166" style="s2">That takes time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.366" end="00:09:15.966" style="s2">So does hiding from Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.233" end="00:09:17.100" style="s2">There&#39;s no body.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.366" end="00:09:18.366" style="s2">Then there&#39;s no story.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.900" end="00:09:20.166" style="s2">You didn&#39;t see her face.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.166" end="00:09:21.366" style="s2">I don&#39;t need her face.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.366" end="00:09:23.100" style="s2">I need this contained.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.366" end="00:09:24.633" style="s2">She was mine</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.633" end="00:09:25.700" style="s2">to bring back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.100" end="00:09:29.900" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.633" end="00:09:31.633" style="s2">Elena...</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.633" end="00:09:32.233" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.233" end="00:09:33.700" style="s2">I can&#39;t find either heartbeat.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.700" end="00:09:34.433" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.433" end="00:09:35.033" style="s2">Check again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.033" end="00:09:35.700" style="s2">I did.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.700" end="00:09:36.366" style="s2">Twice.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.033" end="00:09:37.900" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.033" end="00:09:39.966" style="s2">They were right here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.166" end="00:09:40.566" style="s2">Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.566" end="00:09:41.966" style="s2">I need to give you something<br />for the pain.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.100" end="00:09:42.833" style="s2">Pain is fine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.966" end="00:09:43.700" style="s2">Change course.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.700" end="00:09:44.833" style="s2">Keep her off every channel</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.966" end="00:09:45.766" style="s2">For how long?</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.833" end="00:09:47.300" style="s2">Until the world believes she&#39;s<br />dead.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.300" end="00:09:49.300" style="s2">Why were you there?</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.300" end="00:09:50.433" style="s2">Because you were never</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.433" end="00:09:51.900" style="s2">supposed to reach that wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.433" end="00:09:56.366" style="s2">Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.500" end="00:10:00.900" style="s2">You asked for whiskey.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.900" end="00:10:05.100" style="s2">I didn&#39;t ask you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.633" end="00:10:06.900" style="s2">I&#39;m the only one here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.233" end="00:10:10.033" style="s2">Perfume.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.433" end="00:10:12.100" style="s2">Whose?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.100" end="00:10:13.233" style="s2">I thought you liked it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.433" end="00:10:15.300" style="s2">Wash it off.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.633" end="00:10:16.366" style="s2">She&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.566" end="00:10:17.900" style="s2">Don&#39;t say that in my house.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.966" end="00:10:18.900" style="s2">You hated her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.966" end="00:10:19.366" style="s2">Out.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.366" end="00:10:20.700" style="s2">You don&#39;t even know what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.233" end="00:10:29.033" style="s2">Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.233" end="00:10:31.233" style="s2">There&#39;s still no b*dy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.833" end="00:10:33.166" style="s2">Then there&#39;s still no story.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.966" end="00:10:34.766" style="s2">You&#39;re not listening.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.166" end="00:10:36.366" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t just disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.633" end="00:10:38.566" style="s2">Then make sure no one proves she didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.700" end="00:10:40.300" style="s2">Doctor,</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.966" end="00:10:42.633" style="s2">tell me it isn&#39;t true.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.633" end="00:10:44.033" style="s2">My baby, they can&#39;t be gone,</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.033" end="00:10:44.500" style="s2">can they?</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.500" end="00:10:45.033" style="s2">Ms. Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.033" end="00:10:46.366" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.633" end="00:10:47.366" style="s2">It is true.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.433" end="00:10:48.433" style="s2">We did everything we could,</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.433" end="00:10:49.633" style="s2">but we couldn&#39;t save them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.900" end="00:10:54.766" style="s2">Don&#39;t come closer.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.900" end="00:10:55.700" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.700" end="00:10:56.766" style="s2">I won&#39;t touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.100" end="00:10:58.966" style="s2">Neither will the doctor unless you want us to.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.500" end="00:11:01.500" style="s2">It&#39;s you,</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.900" end="00:11:04.233" style="s2">the voice from the boat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.900" end="00:11:05.433" style="s2">Yeah,</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.500" end="00:11:06.433" style="s2">that was me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.500" end="00:11:07.500" style="s2">Why did you save me?</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.500" end="00:11:08.966" style="s2">How did you know this would happen?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.366" end="00:11:10.566" style="s2">My name&#39;s Lucien.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.566" end="00:11:11.233" style="s2">Months ago,</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.233" end="00:11:11.833" style="s2">outside a hospital,</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.833" end="00:11:13.033" style="s2">you dropped your paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.166" end="00:11:14.166" style="s2">I saw your name.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.166" end="00:11:15.100" style="s2">I saw Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.966" end="00:11:21.900" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.100" end="00:11:23.700" style="s2">Boss?</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.700" end="00:11:24.366" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.366" end="00:11:25.300" style="s2">That&#39;s Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.300" end="00:11:26.100" style="s2">Put someone on her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.500" end="00:11:27.433" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t watching you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.433" end="00:11:28.433" style="s2">I was looking into them.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.633" end="00:11:29.833" style="s2">When I found out about the<br />wedding,</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.833" end="00:11:31.233" style="s2">I put people near every exit.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.433" end="00:11:33.633" style="s2">So you followed me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.966" end="00:11:34.966" style="s2">I followed Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.966" end="00:11:36.300" style="s2">And that&#39;s supposed to sound better?</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.566" end="00:11:37.033" style="s2">No</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.300" end="00:11:38.166" style="s2">but it&#39;s the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.766" end="00:11:42.766" style="s2">They were here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.900" end="00:11:43.766" style="s2">I had them,</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.766" end="00:11:44.500" style="s2">they were mine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.033" end="00:11:45.500" style="s2">Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.100" end="00:11:48.500" style="s2">I know, I know.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.100" end="00:11:50.100" style="s2">Caspian watched.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.300" end="00:11:51.100" style="s2">Silas laughed.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.100" end="00:11:52.233" style="s2">And I lost them.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.500" end="00:11:54.033" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to be brave<br />right now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.833" end="00:11:56.700" style="s2">I hate them,</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.300" end="00:11:58.366" style="s2">I want them to suffer.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.766" end="00:12:00.633" style="s2">Then live long enough to make sure they do.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.433" end="00:12:02.233" style="s2">How?</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.433" end="00:12:03.366" style="s2">Not as Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.366" end="00:12:08.566" style="s2">You want to erase me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.833" end="00:12:09.733" style="s2">No,</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.233" end="00:12:11.766" style="s2">just the version of you they<br />can find.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.566" end="00:12:14.300" style="s2">New name.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.566" end="00:12:15.500" style="s2">New records.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.500" end="00:12:16.166" style="s2">New face.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.966" end="00:12:18.300" style="s2">Only if that&#39;s what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.700" end="00:12:22.833" style="s2">They won&#39;t recognize me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.100" end="00:12:26.100" style="s2">They could look right at you</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.100" end="00:12:27.500" style="s2">and never know who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.900" end="00:12:31.966" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to decide who I<br />become.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.366" end="00:12:35.833" style="s2">Elena di*d in that water.</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.366" end="00:12:37.433" style="s2">Who do you want to be?</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.200" end="00:12:40.000" style="s2">Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.833" end="00:12:42.633" style="s2">Hold still</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.233" end="00:12:44.166" style="s2">Just do it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.766" end="00:12:47.566" style="s2">Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.366" end="00:12:50.966" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.566" end="00:12:53.266" style="s2">Blackwood won&#39;t know you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.433" end="00:12:55.966" style="s2">Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.100" end="00:12:56.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.100" end="00:12:58.100" style="s2">You need time.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.100" end="00:13:02.233" style="s2">I had three months.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.500" end="00:13:05.633" style="s2">Then start with what they think happened to you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.633" end="00:13:06.833" style="s2">Did they bury me clean?</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.833" end="00:13:07.766" style="s2">They cleaned it up.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.766" end="00:13:11.566" style="s2">Accident?</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.366" end="00:13:13.500" style="s2">That&#39;s the word they bought.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.300" end="00:13:15.766" style="s2">Caspian watched me fall</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.200" end="00:13:17.166" style="s2">yes</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.166" end="00:13:18.700" style="s2">Then I want him to invite me<br />in.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.900" end="00:13:20.166" style="s2">That takes more than a face.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.433" end="00:13:25.300" style="s2">A face gets you invited.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.433" end="00:13:27.766" style="s2">And after that?</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.766" end="00:13:30.100" style="s2">First, survive the room.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.900" end="00:13:31.433" style="s2">Then?</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.833" end="00:13:33.566" style="s2">Then decide where it hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.300" end="00:13:36.100" style="s2">Scent.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.166" end="00:13:41.166" style="s2">Bitter orange.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.166" end="00:13:42.033" style="s2">Smoke.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.033" end="00:13:42.700" style="s2">Salt.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.233" end="00:13:45.166" style="s2">White pepper.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.233" end="00:13:47.233" style="s2">Orchid.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.300" end="00:13:48.500" style="s2">Not rose.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.900" end="00:13:50.966" style="s2">She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.233" end="00:13:51.833" style="s2">Continue.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.566" end="00:13:53.433" style="s2">Too sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.433" end="00:13:54.366" style="s2">Silas would trust it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.366" end="00:13:55.166" style="s2">Caspian wouldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.166" end="00:13:56.966" style="s2">Then build something Caspian<br />can&#39;t dismiss.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.766" end="00:13:59.233" style="s2">Give me the part he hides.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.433" end="00:14:00.300" style="s2">Insomnia.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.366" end="00:14:05.966" style="s2">Name it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.500" end="00:14:07.300" style="s2">Drowned.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.300" end="00:14:08.700" style="s2">That name will hurt you first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.966" end="00:14:10.900" style="s2">It already did.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.833" end="00:14:12.900" style="s2">Then why use it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.100" end="00:14:16.500" style="s2">Because he&#39;ll open it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.566" end="00:14:20.566" style="s2">Once this reaches him, he&#39;l<br />start looking.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.233" end="00:14:21.966" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.366" end="00:14:24.366" style="s2">If he looks too hard?</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.366" end="00:14:25.966" style="s2">Then he sees what I let him<br />see.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.166" end="00:14:29.433" style="s2">Eve Laurent ships it in the<br />morning.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.433" end="00:14:30.900" style="s2">No. Tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.833" end="00:14:33.966" style="s2">The Paris perfumer sent a<br />sample.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.433" end="00:14:34.966" style="s2">Return it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.566" end="00:14:36.566" style="s2">It has a name.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.833" end="00:14:38.100" style="s2">So does every bottle</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.700" end="00:14:39.566" style="s2">Drowned.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.300" end="00:14:41.233" style="s2">Say that again:</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.833" end="00:14:42.766" style="s2">Drowned.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.300" end="00:14:46.033" style="s2">Who sent it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.033" end="00:14:47.233" style="s2">Eve Laurent. Paris.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.100" end="00:14:49.300" style="s2">Put her on the auction list.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.700" end="00:14:50.566" style="s2">As a guest?</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.833" end="00:14:51.500" style="s2">As bait.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.833" end="00:14:55.233" style="s2">Blackwood updated your<br />invitation, Ms. Laurent.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.833" end="00:14:57.700" style="s2">That was fast.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.433" end="00:15:04.966" style="s2">He moved you from a sample to a stage.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.500" end="00:15:05.900" style="s2">Good.</p>
